# Which rule files a changed path loads, read by review-bundle.sh: a shell case
# pattern (so * crosses a slash), then one rule file in this directory. Every
# matching line counts. general.md and false-positives.md load for every change
# and are not listed. A path no line matches is listed by the bundle as
# unruled: read against the general rules only, which the report says. Each
# path a rule's "Applies to" line names is routed to that rule's file here, and
# tests/test_skill_scripts.py holds the two to each other.
